{"version":1,"content":"<p>一項最新研究發現，南極海冰近年來持續減少，正在引發南半球海洋深層結構的顯著變化。觀測數據顯示，一層覆蓋範圍極廣的重要海水層正變得更鹹、更密集，並逐漸下沉。這種變化可能導致更多熱量進入深海，其影響程度甚至超出當前氣候模型的預測範圍。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1585948.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T11:57:33.242762+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T11:39:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T11:50:53.161061+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T11:50:53.161061+00:00","content_hash":"b706bc7b8e0abcc31fdc12b8001560b97e97b575ec7f131faf193686d0cc61cb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}